start game
    initialize player at x=4
    randomly spawn enemy at top row
    wait for player input (A/B/A+B)

loop forever:
    clear LED panel
    draw player (blue)
    draw enemy (green)

    if bullet is active:
        draw bullet (red)
        move bullet up
        if bullet hits top -> deactivate
        if bullet hits enemy:
            reset enemy
            deactivate bullet

    every 600ms:
        move enemy down or left/right based on pattern
        if enemy reaches bottom and hits player:
            game over
